    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30484" root="عمج" body-key="E">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَمَجَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَمِجَ</span></b> , <i>He hastened,</i> or <i>was quick,</i> or

<i>swift, in his pace,</i> or <i>course:</i> (S, O, K:) formed
by transposition from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعَجَ</span>. (S, O.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And,
(K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَمَجَ فِى المَآءِ</span>, (O,) <i>He swam in the
water.</i> (O, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also the next paragraph,
in two places.

